        "title": "\"I have watched students abandon their altruistic intentions\"",
        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/214902/I-have-watched-students-abandon-their-altruistic-intentions",
        "content_text": "<a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/18/opinion/business-school-mba-harvard-cornell-cambridge.html\">I Teach at a Business School. It's Time to Shut Them Down.</a> (<a href=\"https://archive.is/MALBh\">archive</a>)",
