        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/iphone-hand-off.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Following T-Mobile and Deutsche Telekom, Verizon has now confirmed how much it will charge customers to use Apple’s new iPhone Handoff feature. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"iphone\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074654\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/16/verizon-confirms-10-monthly-fee-for-new-iphone-handoff-feature/#more-1074654\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
