        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/ipad-mini-6-jb.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">While Apple is rumored to be gearing up to introduce an OLED iPad mini later this month, an oversight on the company’s French site might have just confirmed the product’s existence. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ipad-mini\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074497\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/15/apple-lists-unreleased-ipad-mini-accessory-ahead-of-rumored-launch/#more-1074497\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
