        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/21/slow-horses-showrunner-explains-finale-shock-ending-season-7-trailer-debuts/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/slow-horses-s6-jackson-lamb-phone.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Slow Horses season 6 finale <a href=\"https://tv.apple.com/show/slow-horses/umc.cmc.2szz3fdt71tl1ulnbp8utgq5o?itscg=30200&amp;itsct=tv_box_link&amp;mttnsubad=umc.cmc.2szz3fdt71tl1ulnbp8utgq5o&amp;at=1000l3cvR\">is available now</a>, with a shocking ending that is explained by new showrunner Gaby Chiappe in an interview. Plus, Apple has debuted the first trailer for season 7.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-tv\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1075187\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/21/slow-horses-showrunner-explains-finale-shock-ending-season-7-trailer-debuts/#more-1075187\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
