        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/21/deals-apple-tv-4k-iphone-duo-power-bank-airpods-pro-3/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/Apple-deals-Apple-TV-4L-AirPods-Pro-3-iPhone-Duo-power-bank.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Alongside the ongoing pre-order discount on the new Apple TV 4K, Amazon is still shipping <strong>$50 off</strong>. Just be sure to check out the all-time low on HyperDrive Next Thunderbolt 5 Dock. Everything else awaits below. </p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"9to5toys,9to5toys-lunch-break,deals\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1075192\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/21/deals-apple-tv-4k-iphone-duo-power-bank-airpods-pro-3/#more-1075192\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
