        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/19/third-rcs-for-macos-sequoia-15-8-2-and-macos-tahoe-26-7-2-rolling-out/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/06/macOS-26-Tahoe-purple.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In addition to <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/19/first-release-candidate-for-macos-27-2-golden-gate-now-available/\">macOS 27.2 Golden Gate RC 1</a>, Apple is also rolling out the third developer and public RCs for macOS Sequoia 15.8.2 and macOS Tahoe 26.7.2. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"macos,macos-15-8-2,macos-26-7-2\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074775\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/19/third-rcs-for-macos-sequoia-15-8-2-and-macos-tahoe-26-7-2-rolling-out/#more-1074775\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
