        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/ultra-4-siri-modular-apple-watch.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple Watch sleep apnea notifications launched two years ago. Since then, the health feature has been quietly working in the background and making a difference for people who may not know they need it.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074817\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/19/apple-watch-warned-a-veteran-about-a-health-problem-he-didnt-know-he-had/#more-1074817\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
