        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/19/apple-announces-special-event-for-october-28/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/pro-and-tell.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple today announced its second experience of the month, taking place next Wednesday, October 28 at 10 a.m. PT. The tagline for this event is: “Pro and tell.” Here’s what to expect.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074583\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/19/apple-announces-special-event-for-october-28/#more-1074583\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
