        "title": "Apple explains why HomeView couldn’t launch until now",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/20/apple-explains-why-homeview-couldnt-launch-until-now/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/Apple-HomeView-lifestyle-living-room-261013_big.jpg.large_2x-2.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple’s new HomeView was <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2024/11/13/apples-new-homepad-is-exactly-what-i-want-in-a-home-device/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"978078\">reportedly</a> mostly finished for years, but kept getting delayed. Here’s why HomeView couldn’t launch until now, per quotes from key Apple execs.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"homeview\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074918\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/20/apple-explains-why-homeview-couldnt-launch-until-now/#more-1074918\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
