        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/16/iphone-duo-pre-orders-now-backordered-to-next-year/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/iphone-duo-front-display-hand.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iPhone Duo, Apple’s first foldable iPhone, went up for pre-order today. Within minutes of pre-orders opening, however, estimated delivery dates started slipping all the way to next year. </p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"iphone-duo\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074526\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/16/iphone-duo-pre-orders-now-backordered-to-next-year/#more-1074526\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
