        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/16/iphone-duo-now-available-to-pre-order-prices-start-at-1999/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/iphone-duo-10.jpeg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple’s first-ever foldable iPhone is <a href=\"https://apple.sjv.io/gRKbOB\">now available for pre-order</a>. You can head to Apple’s website or the Apple Store app this morning to place your iPhone Duo pre-order, with the first orders arriving in one week on October 23.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"iphone-duo\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074519\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/16/iphone-duo-now-available-to-pre-order-prices-start-at-1999/#more-1074519\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
